<p class="eyebrow" data-copy-en="Character guide" data-copy-zh="角色攻略">Character guide</p>
<h1 data-copy-en="Noella" data-copy-zh="Noella">Noella</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Find Noella at Mistletoe Lodge and track her affection, Extras milestones and Christmas rewards." data-copy-zh="在槲寄生小屋找到Noella，了解好感、附加内容里程碑与圣诞奖励。">Find Noella at Mistletoe Lodge and track her affection, Extras milestones and Christmas rewards.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">去哪里找</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">卡住时检查什么</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Mistletoe_Kiss:_Christmas_Task_1"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Noella.27s_Reward_at_80.25"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Noella's_Reward_at_80%"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Four_Automatic_Extras_Milestones"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Check_the_List_and_Extras_Completion"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Eight_Affection_Milestones"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Getting_There"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Noella — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/noella.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Noella — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/noella.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Noella — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Noella hosts Mistletoe Lodge. Her route combines affection milestones, collection milestones, a repeatable reward scene and a short Christmas task.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><h2>Where to find them</h2><p>In the Future Fringe Zone, use Weather Control to reach Sky-Level Atmospheric Management Station, enter Christmas Village, then Mistletoe Lodge. Noella is there all day; ordinary access does not depend on the calendar date or an event code.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Christmas_Spirit_and_Route_Boundaries"></span><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Talk until Acknowledged (10), then use Check the List to see your current Extras completion. Chocolate opens at Acquaintance (50); the Christmas Hot Chocolate prize can be given from Known (25).</p><p>Visit the lodge as affection rises for the eight scenes below. Collection scenes at 15%, 30%, 45% and 60% Extras completion are separate from affection stages. Each grants one Token and respectively 5, 10, 15 or 20 base affection. The In Love affection scene grants two Tokens; the other affection milestones grant one each.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Automatic scene</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">The Naughty and Nice List</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Mistletoe Lodge</td><td data-label="Requirements">Known (25)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Art of Connection</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Mistletoe Lodge</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acquaintance (50)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Cocoa and Confidences</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Mistletoe Lodge</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A Private Invitation</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Mistletoe Lodge</td><td data-label="Requirements">Close Friend (200)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Slow Burn</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Mistletoe Lodge</td><td data-label="Requirements">Crush (400)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Full Flame</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Mistletoe Lodge</td><td data-label="Requirements">Romantic (800)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Taking the Lead</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Mistletoe Lodge</td><td data-label="Requirements">Intimate (1600)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Forever Yours</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Mistletoe Lodge</td><td data-label="Requirements">In Love (3000)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">First Entries</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Mistletoe Lodge</td><td data-label="Requirements">Extras completion 15%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Growing Collection</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Mistletoe Lodge</td><td data-label="Requirements">Extras completion 30%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Halfway Through</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Mistletoe Lodge</td><td data-label="Requirements">Extras completion 45%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Deep Connections</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Mistletoe Lodge</td><td data-label="Requirements">Extras completion 60%</td></tr></tbody></table><p>At Acknowledged (10) and 80% Extras completion, choose Noella's Reward. It takes 30 minutes and 30 Energy and gives 25 base affection. The scene remains repeatable, but its two Tokens are awarded only on the first live completion. Once earned, reward access remains available if later catalogue additions lower the displayed percentage.</p></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Daily_Conversations_and_Gifts"></span><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / start window</th><th scope="col">Cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Noella</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Mistletoe Lodge; Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">25 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+1 base affection; 7/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Chocolate</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Mistletoe Lodge; Acquaintance (50)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">20 min; 1 Chocolate</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+3 base affection; 7/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Hot Chocolate</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Mistletoe Lodge; Known (25)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">20 min; 1 Hot Chocolate</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+10 base affection; 80/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Check the List</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Mistletoe Lodge; Acknowledged (10)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">0 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">shows current Extras completion</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Noella's Reward</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Mistletoe Lodge; Acknowledged (10)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">30 min; 30 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">25 base affection; repeatable scene; 2 Tokens on first live completion only</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Mistletoe Kiss is a separate once-only Christmas task: Known (25), 5 minutes, Christmas activities enabled; one Token and 10 direct affection. It does not require buying a gift.</p><p>Turning seasonal activities off pauses those tasks and seasonal pickups. It does not remove the village or Noella’s ordinary conversations. Learn Christmas Spirit through its own skill source to improve her relationship bonus.</p><p>Favorite stats are Intelligence, Creativity, Cooking. Learning Christmas Spirit improves the relationship bonus.</p><p>Start times are shown; the ending hour is excluded. Base affection receives the relationship bonuses, while direct affection is added as listed. Ordinary affection, player Erotic Experience and NPC intimacy experience are separate.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Troubleshooting"></span><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><ul><li>A lower Extras percentage does not remove a reward you already qualified for. You still need Acknowledged (10).</li><li>Hot Chocolate uses one prize from the Christmas activity inventory. Ordinary Chocolate is a separate consumable.</li><li>Replaying a collected scene in Extras does not award live affection or Tokens. Repeating the live reward scene does not generate more Tokens.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-christmas-village.html">Christmas Village: activities and prizes</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-objectives-and-achievements.html">Extras and achievement progress</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">Relationship bonuses and intimacy</a></li><li><a href="skills.html">Skill locations</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Mistletoe_Kiss:_Christmas_Task_1"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Noella.27s_Reward_at_80.25"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Noella's_Reward_at_80%"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Four_Automatic_Extras_Milestones"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Check_the_List_and_Extras_Completion"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Eight_Affection_Milestones"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Getting_There"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Noella 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/noella.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Noella 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/noella.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Noella 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Noella是槲寄生小屋的主人。她的内容围绕好感里程碑、收藏进度、可重复的奖励事件，以及一项圣诞任务展开。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><h2>去哪里找</h2><p>在未来的边缘区选择“天气控制”，进入天空级大气管理站，再前往圣诞村和槲寄生小屋。Noella全天在场；日常来访不受现实节日或活动兑换码限制。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Christmas_Spirit_and_Route_Boundaries"></span><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>先通过交谈达到已遇见（10好感），再用查看清单查看附加内容完成率。巧克力在相识（50好感）开放；圣诞活动奖品热巧克力则在已知（25好感）即可赠送。</p><p>好感提高后回旅馆触发下表中的8个事件。附加内容完成率达到15%、30%、45%、60%时，另有4个收藏事件，与好感阶段分开计算；各奖励圣诞代币1枚，基础好感分别增加5、10、15、20。恋爱中的好感事件奖励代币2枚，其余好感里程碑各1枚。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">自动事件</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">淘气与乖巧名单</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">槲寄生小屋</td><td data-label="条件">已知（25好感）</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">联结的艺术</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">槲寄生小屋</td><td data-label="条件">相识（50好感）</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">可可与知心话</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">槲寄生小屋</td><td data-label="条件">朋友（100好感）</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">私密的邀约</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">槲寄生小屋</td><td data-label="条件">亲密朋友（200好感）</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">细水慢炖</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">槲寄生小屋</td><td data-label="条件">迷恋（400好感）</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">烈焰全燃</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">槲寄生小屋</td><td data-label="条件">浪漫感（800好感）</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">由她掌控</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">槲寄生小屋</td><td data-label="条件">亲密（1600好感）</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">永远属于你</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">槲寄生小屋</td><td data-label="条件">恋爱中（3000好感）</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">初录名册</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">槲寄生小屋</td><td data-label="条件">附加内容完成率15%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">渐丰的收藏</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">槲寄生小屋</td><td data-label="条件">附加内容完成率30%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">行至半途</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">槲寄生小屋</td><td data-label="条件">附加内容完成率45%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">深层的联结</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">槲寄生小屋</td><td data-label="条件">附加内容完成率60%</td></tr></tbody></table><p>达到已遇见（10好感）且附加内容完成率达到80%后，选择Noella的奖励，消耗30分钟和30精力，获得25基础好感。事件可以重复，但其中的2枚圣诞代币仅在首次实际完成时发放。取得资格后，即使收藏目录扩充导致完成率降低，也会保留奖励入口。</p></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Daily_Conversations_and_Gifts"></span><h2>行动与奖励</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">和 Noella 交谈</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">槲寄生小屋；陌生人（0好感）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">25分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+1；每天7次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送巧克力</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">槲寄生小屋；相识（50好感）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">20分钟；巧克力×1</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+3；每天7次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送热巧克力</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">槲寄生小屋；已知（25好感）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">20分钟；热巧克力×1</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+10；每天80次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">查看清单</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">槲寄生小屋；已遇见（10好感）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">0分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">查看当前附加内容完成率</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Noella的奖励</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">槲寄生小屋；已遇见（10好感）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">30分钟；30精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感25；事件可重复；仅首次实际完成获得代币2枚</td></tr></tbody></table><p>槲寄生之吻是另一项一次性圣诞任务：已知（25好感）、5分钟，并开启圣诞活动；奖励圣诞代币1枚和10直接好感，不需要购买礼物。</p><p>关闭节庆活动会暂停相关任务与活动拾取，不会关闭村庄或Noella的日常交谈。圣诞精神需到对应技能来源学习，可提高她的关系加成。</p><p>偏好的属性为智力、创造力、烹饪。学会圣诞精神可提高关系加成。</p><p>表中均为开始时间，不包含结束整点。基础好感受关系加成影响，直接好感按所列数值增加。普通好感、玩家情趣经验和NPC亲密经验分别计算。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Troubleshooting"></span><h2>卡住时检查什么</h2><ul><li>已经取得奖励资格后，不必为了目录扩充后下降的百分比重新达到80%；仍需已遇见（10好感）。</li><li>热巧克力消耗圣诞活动库存中的奖品；普通巧克力是另一种消耗品。</li><li>在附加内容中回看已收藏事件，不会获得实际好感或代币；重复实际奖励事件也不会继续发放代币。</li></ul></section>
<section id="zh-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Related_Pages"></span><h2>相关指南</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-christmas-village.html">圣诞村：活动与奖品</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-objectives-and-achievements.html">附加内容与成就进度</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">关系加成与亲密互动</a></li><li><a href="skills.html">技能学习地点</a></li></ul></section>
